  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "A farewell speech usually covers four points. First, we look back on what we have seen and done together in this city, and thank you for your cooperation, expressing our sincere regret at your departure. Second, we honestly ask for your comments and suggestions on our service. Third, we apologize for anything that fell short of your expectations. And fourth, we look forward to meeting you again, and wish you a safe and pleasant journey home. Bon voyage!\n【中文对照】欢送词应包括以下四项内容：回顾旅游者在当地的旅游活动，对其合作表示感谢，对他们的离去表示惜别之情；诚恳征求旅游者对接待工作的意见和建议；对服务的不足之处表示歉意；期待再次重逢，祝旅游者的旅途平安顺利。（摘编自《北京导游服务能力》送行服务）",
