  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Now please let me brief you on tomorrow's program: the itinerary, the walking distance, the weather forecast and what to wear, as well as the time and place to gather, our bus number and its mark. Please deposit your valuables at the front desk or lock them in the safe in your room, and remember the code. Mind that some items in the room are charged separately. Please note where the fire exits are, and lock your door when you leave.\n【中文对照】宣布次日的活动安排、行走路程，进行天气预报，提供衣物建议，宣布集合时间、地点、车号及标志等；强调贵重物品交前台或锁进客房保险箱并记住密码，提醒客房内收费项目、饭店安全通道位置及房间安全提示等注意事项。（摘编自《北京导游服务能力》入住服务）",
