  "ref": "For reasons of religion, habit or health, some tourists may have special dietary requests, for example, no meat, no spicy food, or no pork. When a tourist asks for a change of menu, the guide should contact the restaurant at once and try to satisfy the request. If it is really impossible, the guide should explain the situation and suggest ordering a la carte in another restaurant, at the tourist's own expense.",
