  "id": "IE-E2C-007",
  "title": "机场值机与超重行李（Checking in at the Airport）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "A: Sir, have you got any luggage to check? A: Could you label them and put them on the scales, please? B: All right. A: I'm afraid your luggage is overweight. B: How much luggage can I carry? A: As a rule, the free luggage allowance is 20 kilos, your luggage is 3 kilos overweight, so I'm afraid you have to pay an excess luggage charge. B: What's the overweight charge per kilo? A: 15 dollars. B: OK, here you are. A: Here's your ticket and boarding pass. Have a pleasant flight.\n【中文对照】甲：先生，您有行李要托运吗？甲：请把行李贴上标签，放到秤上好吗？乙：好的。甲：恐怕您的行李超重了。乙：我能免费带多少行李？甲：按规定，免费行李额是二十公斤，您的行李超重三公斤，恐怕您得支付超重行李费。乙：超重费每公斤多少钱？甲：十五美元。乙：好的，给您。甲：这是您的机票和登机牌，祝您旅途愉快。",
  "direction": "e2c",
  "src": "A: Sir, have you got any luggage to check? A: Could you label them and put them on the scales, please? B: All right. A: I'm afraid your luggage is overweight. B: How much luggage can I carry? A: As a rule, the free luggage allowance is 20 kilos, your luggage is 3 kilos overweight, so I'm afraid you have to pay an excess luggage charge. B: What's the overweight charge per kilo? A: 15 dollars. B: OK, here you are. A: Here's your ticket and boarding pass. Have a pleasant flight.",
  "ref": "甲：先生，您有行李要托运吗？甲：请把行李贴上标签，放到秤上好吗？乙：好的。甲：恐怕您的行李超重了。乙：我能免费带多少行李？甲：按规定，免费行李额是二十公斤，您的行李超重三公斤，恐怕您得支付超重行李费。乙：超重费每公斤多少钱？甲：十五美元。乙：好的，给您。甲：这是您的机票和登机牌，祝您旅途愉快。",
  "anchor": "",
  "context": "所属模块：口译；出处：2026备考材料·05-英译汉篇章",
  "source": "2026备考材料·口译训练",
  "status": "✅",
