  "id": "IE-E2C-027",
  "title": "购物安排原则（How to Arrange Shopping）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "If you're a local guide, you need to take your tourists to do some shopping. However, what should a tour guide do when arranging a shopping for tourists? Please do as following advised: The guide has to take the tour group shopping only at shops designated by the contract. The local guide is not permitted to add extra shops or shopping time. If tourists request to go shopping by themselves, the guide may agree if there is enough time. If tourists want to buy some antiques, the guide has to remind tourists of keeping sales receipts and sign of authenticity, which should be provided by antique shops. Without those documents, antiques may not be allowed to take abroad. If tourists want to buy traditional Chinese medicine, the guide has to show them to the reliable drugstores, as well as inform them of the limit of traditional Chinese medicine one can take out of China's mainland for personal use.\n【中文对照】如果你是一名地接导游，就需要带游客去购物。那么，为游客安排购物时，导游应该怎么做呢？请按以下建议执行：一、导游只能带团到合同指定的商店购物，地接导游不得擅自增加购物点或延长购物时间。二、如果游客提出自行购物，在时间允许的情况下，导游可以同意。三、游客想购买古玩时，导游必须提醒他们保留销售凭据和真品鉴定标识——这些文件应由古玩店提供；没有这些文件，古玩可能无法带出境。四、游客想购买中草药时，导游必须带他们到可靠的药店，并告知国家关于个人自用中草药带出中国大陆的限量规定。",
  "direction": "e2c",
  "src": "If you're a local guide, you need to take your tourists to do some shopping. However, what should a tour guide do when arranging a shopping for tourists? Please do as following advised: The guide has to take the tour group shopping only at shops designated by the contract. The local guide is not permitted to add extra shops or shopping time. If tourists request to go shopping by themselves, the guide may agree if there is enough time. If tourists want to buy some antiques, the guide has to remind tourists of keeping sales receipts and sign of authenticity, which should be provided by antique shops. Without those documents, antiques may not be allowed to take abroad. If tourists want to buy traditional Chinese medicine, the guide has to show them to the reliable drugstores, as well as inform them of the limit of traditional Chinese medicine one can take out of China's mainland for personal use.",
  "ref": "如果你是一名地接导游，就需要带游客去购物。那么，为游客安排购物时，导游应该怎么做呢？请按以下建议执行：一、导游只能带团到合同指定的商店购物，地接导游不得擅自增加购物点或延长购物时间。二、如果游客提出自行购物，在时间允许的情况下，导游可以同意。三、游客想购买古玩时，导游必须提醒他们保留销售凭据和真品鉴定标识——这些文件应由古玩店提供；没有这些文件，古玩可能无法带出境。四、游客想购买中草药时，导游必须带他们到可靠的药店，并告知国家关于个人自用中草药带出中国大陆的限量规定。",
  "anchor": "",
  "context": "所属模块：口译；出处：2026备考材料·05-英译汉篇章",
  "source": "2026备考材料·口译训练",
  "status": "✅",
  "exam_tip": "四条原则对应\"指定商店／自行购物／古玩凭据／中草药限量\"，问答与口译双向可考； Without those documents… 的否定义务句须完整译出。",
  "origin": "",
