  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Short passage: Lost and found. A tourist loses his camera in the scenic area. The guide helps him recall where he last used it, and registers the loss at the lost-and-found office of the site; the office may check the camera surveillance. When the camera is found, the owner checks the item and signs to receive it, and the guide reminds everyone to carry valuables with them.\n【中文对照】短篇：失物招领。游客在景区丢失相机，导游协助回忆最后一次使用地点，联系景区失物招领处登记报备；如有监控协助调取；找回后请失主核对物品并签字领取，提醒贵重物品随身携带。",
