  "ref": "Short passage: Lost and found. A tourist loses his camera in the scenic area. The guide helps him recall where he last used it, and registers the loss at the lost-and-found office of the site; the office may check the camera surveillance. When the camera is found, the owner checks the item and signs to receive it, and the guide reminds everyone to carry valuables with them.",
