  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Short passage: Calling the police over a dispute. When a tourist falls into a dispute with a vendor, the guide first separates the two sides and leads the tourist away to avoid a crowd. After learning what happened, he tries to settle it through negotiation; if that fails, he reminds the tourist to complain to the market supervision authority or dial 110, keeping the receipt as proof.\n【中文对照】短篇：遇到纠纷报警。游客与商贩发生纠纷，导游先将双方劝开，把游客带离现场，防止围观起哄；了解情况后协商解决，协商不成提醒游客向市场监督部门投诉或拨打 110，并保留购物凭证。",
  "direction": "c2e",
