  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Short passage: Insurance claim. After the tourist receives treatment, the guide reminds him to keep the medical record, the diagnosis certificate, the test reports and the original invoices, so that he can claim from the insurance company at home. If needed, the agency may issue a certificate of what happened. The more complete the papers, the smoother the claim.\n【中文对照】短篇：保险理赔。游客就诊后，导游提醒保留病历、诊断证明、检查单据与发票原件，回国后向保险公司索赔；如需旅行社协助，可出具事故经过证明；理赔材料越完整，越顺利。",
