  "ref": "Short passage: Insurance claim. After the tourist receives treatment, the guide reminds him to keep the medical record, the diagnosis certificate, the test reports and the original invoices, so that he can claim from the insurance company at home. If needed, the agency may issue a certificate of what happened. The more complete the papers, the smoother the claim.",
  "anchor": "",
  "context": "所属模块：口译；出处：2026备考材料·06-情景对话口译",
