  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Short passage: Emergency assembly. In an emergency evacuation, the guide organizes the tourists to leave in order along the fire exits, without taking the elevator or returning for belongings. At the assembly point he counts heads, reports and seeks help for anyone missing, calms the tourists, and follows the unified command on the spot.\n【中文对照】短篇：紧急集合。遇突发情况需要疏散时，导游立即按照应急预案组织游客沿安全通道有序撤离，不乘电梯、不返回取物；到指定集合点后清点人数，对未到者立即上报并求助；同时安抚游客情绪，服从现场统一指挥。",
