  "text": "Tomorrow morning we will visit the Forbidden City, which covers 720,000 square meters and was home to 24 emperors of the Ming and Qing dynasties. Please wear comfortable shoes, because we will walk for about two hours inside. Our lunch is arranged at 12:30.\n【中文对照】明天上午我们参观故宫。故宫占地 72 万平方米，曾有明清两代 24 位皇帝在此居住。请穿舒适的鞋，因为我们在里面要走大约两个小时。午餐安排在 12 点 30 分。",
