  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "口译训练卡（中译外/外译中）",
  "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, this monument stands 37.94 meters high. The epitaph on the back was drafted by Chairman Mao and written by Premier Zhou Enlai. Around the base are eight large thematic reliefs, starting with the Destruction of Opium at Humen in 1839 and ending with the Successful Crossing of the Yangtze.\n【中文对照】各位，这座纪念碑高 37.94 米。背面的碑文由毛泽东主席起草、周恩来总理题写。碑座四周是八幅大型主题浮雕，从 1839 年虎门销烟开始，到胜利渡长江结束。",
