  "id": "QA-CITY-001",
  "title": "问答·历史沿革",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How long is the history of Beijing as a city and as a capital?\n【中文对照】北京建城和建都的历史各有多长？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing has a history of more than 3,000 years as a city and more than 870 years as a capital. Around 1045 BC, the State of Yan built its capital Ji in the present area of Beijing. In 1153, the Jin Dynasty made the city its capital under the name Zhongdu, which opened the capital history of the city. The three turning points to remember are 1153, 1272 and 1949.\n【中文对照】北京建城已有三千多年，建都已有八百七十多年。约公元前 1045 年，燕国在今北京地区建都蓟城。1153 年金朝定都于此，称中都，北京从此进入都城时代。要记住三个转折点：1153 年、1272 年和 1949 年。",
  "anchor": "建城史、建都史、蓟城、金中都、转折点",
  "context": "所属模块：问答；出处：2026备考材料·01-城市概况问答",
  "source": "2026备考材料·问答英语",
