  "title": "问答·历史沿革",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Where does the name Yanjing come from?\n【中文对照】\"燕京\"这个名字从何而来？",
  "qa_answer": "The name Yanjing comes from the ancient State of Yan, which had its capital here about three thousand years ago. The Liao Dynasty used Yanjing as an official name for its Nanjing companion capital. Today the name survives in brands and classical poems about the city. It is one of the oldest city names in China.\n【中文对照】\"燕京\"源自约三千年前定都于此的古燕国。辽朝曾把\"燕京\"用作陪都南京的正式名称。如今这个名字保留在品牌名和咏京的诗文中。它是中国最古老的城市名称之一。",
