  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the highest peak in Beijing?\n【中文对照】北京最高峰是哪座山？",
  "qa_answer": "The highest peak in Beijing is Dongling Mountain, also called Lingshan, in Mentougou District in the west. It rises about 2,303 meters above sea level. Because of the altitude, the summit is covered with alpine meadow rather than forest. In summer many visitors climb it to escape the heat of the city.\n【中文对照】北京最高峰是西部门头沟区的东灵山，又称灵山。它海拔约 2303 米。因为山高，山顶覆盖的是高山草甸而不是森林。夏季常有游客登临避暑。",
