  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What type of climate does Beijing have?\n【中文对照】北京属于什么气候类型？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing belongs to the warm temperate zone with a semi-humid continental monsoon climate. It has four distinctive seasons, with short springs and autumns and long summers and winters. Summer is hot with concentrated rain, while winter is cold and dry. The annual average temperature is about 12 to 13 degrees Celsius.\n【中文对照】北京属暖温带半湿润大陆性季风气候。四季分明，春秋短促，冬夏较长。夏季高温多雨，冬季寒冷干燥。年平均气温约 12 到 13 摄氏度。",
