  "text": "When does most of the rain fall in Beijing?\n【中文对照】北京的降水集中在什么时候？",
  "qa_answer": "Most of the rainfall in Beijing comes in July and August. The annual precipitation is about 500 to 600 millimeters on average, and it varies greatly from year to year. Winter sees little rain or snow, so the air is dry. This rainfall pattern is a direct effect of the East Asian monsoon.\n【中文对照】北京降水大多集中在七八月。年均降水量约 500 到 600 毫米，且年际变化很大。冬季雨雪稀少，空气干燥。这样的降水格局正是东亚季风的直接结果。",
