  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When is the best time to visit Beijing?\n【中文对照】什么时候是游览北京的最佳时间？",
  "qa_answer": "The months of May, September and October have the best weather, so they are regarded as the golden season for visitors. Autumn offers clear skies and mild temperatures, and the Fragrant Hills turn red in late October. Spring is pleasant but sometimes windy with occasional dust. Winter is cold, yet after the 2022 Winter Olympics, ice and snow tourism has become a new attraction.\n【中文对照】五月、九月和十月天气最好，被视为游览的黄金季节。秋季天高气爽，十月底香山层林尽染。春天舒适，但有时多风、偶有沙尘。冬天虽冷，但 2022 年冬奥会之后，冰雪旅游成了新看点。",
