  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which five river systems does Beijing belong to?\n【中文对照】北京五大水系是哪五条？",
  "qa_answer": "The rivers of Beijing belong to five systems: the Juma River, the Yongding River, the North Canal, the Chaobai River and the Ji Canal. All of them are branches of the Hai River system and flow finally into the Bohai Sea. Following the slope of the land, most rivers run from the northwest mountains down to the southeast plain. This five-river pattern is a fixed item in the oral examination.\n【中文对照】北京河流分属五大水系：拒马河、永定河、北运河、潮白河和蓟运河。它们都属海河流域，最终汇入渤海。顺着地势，大多数河流自西北山区流向东南平原。这五条水系是口试的固定考点。",
