  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Miyun Reservoir?\n【中文对照】密云水库是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "Miyun Reservoir, built between 1958 and 1960 in the northeastern mountains, is the largest reservoir in North China. It holds about 4.4 billion cubic meters of water at full capacity. It is the main drinking water source of Beijing and is strictly protected. Swimming, fishing and other activities are forbidden in its protected area.\n【中文对照】密云水库建于 1958 至 1960 年，位于东北部山区，是华北最大水库。满蓄时库容约 44 亿立方米。它是北京主要的饮用水源地，受到严格保护。保护区内禁止游泳、捕鱼等活动。",
  "anchor": "密云水库、华北最大、饮用水源",
