  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How many districts does Beijing govern, and how are they grouped?\n【中文对照】北京下辖多少个区，如何分组？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing governs 16 districts. The six urban districts are Dongcheng, Xicheng, Chaoyang, Haidian, Fengtai and Shijingshan. The other ten suburban districts are Mentougou, Fangshan, Tongzhou, Shunyi, Changping, Daxing, Huairou, Pinggu, Miyun and Yanqing. Among them Tongzhou is the city sub-center, and Yanqing hosted the snow events of the 2022 Winter Olympics.\n【中文对照】北京下辖 16 个区。城六区是东城、西城、朝阳、海淀、丰台和石景山。其余十个郊区是门头沟、房山、通州、顺义、昌平、大兴、怀柔、平谷、密云和延庆。其中通州是城市副中心，延庆承办了 2022 年冬奥会雪上项目。",
  "anchor": "16区、城六区、郊十区、通州、延庆",
