  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How many people live in Beijing?\n【中文对照】北京有多少常住人口？",
  "qa_answer": "By the end of 2024, the permanent population of Beijing was 21.832 million, according to the municipal statistics bureau. Most of the residents, about 88 percent, live in urban areas. The city has kept its population at a stable scale under the capital development plan. In a talk it is enough to say that Beijing has more than 21 million residents.\n【中文对照】据市统计局数据，到 2024 年末北京常住人口为 2183.2 万。居民中约 88% 生活在城镇地区。在首都发展规划之下，人口规模保持稳定。口答时说\"北京有两千一百多万人口\"即可。",
