  "text": "What are the city tree and the city flowers of Beijing?\n【中文对照】北京的市树和市花是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The city trees of Beijing are the Chinese pagoda tree and the oriental arborvitae, and the city flowers are the Chinese rose and the chrysanthemum. The pagoda tree has shaded the hutongs for centuries, and old arborvitae trees still stand in imperial temples. The rose blooms for most of the year, while the chrysanthemum marks the autumn. They are easy points in a city-profile conversation.\n【中文对照】北京的市树是国槐和侧柏，市花是月季和菊花。国槐荫蔽胡同数百年，古侧柏仍立于皇家坛庙。月季几乎全年开花，菊花则属于秋天。在概况闲谈中这是很讨巧的考点。",
