  "text": "What do the mountains of Beijing produce?\n【中文对照】北京山区出产什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The mountains around Beijing produce famous fruits such as the grinding-stone persimmon of Fangshan and the chestnuts of Huairou. Mountain areas also supply walnuts, apricots and honey to the city. Orchards on the sunny slopes have supported village tourism for years. These local products often appear as gifts that guides recommend to visitors.\n【中文对照】环京山区出产房山磨盘柿、怀柔板栗等名果。山区还向城市供应核桃、杏和蜂蜜。向阳坡地的果园多年来支撑起乡村旅游。导游向游客推荐伴手礼时，这些土产常在名单上。",
