  "title": "问答·城市规划与发展",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When did Universal Beijing Resort open?\n【中文对照】北京环球度假区何时开园？",
  "qa_answer": "Universal Beijing Resort opened on September 20, 2021, in Tongzhou as the first Universal theme park in China. It is the third Universal park in Asia, after Osaka and Singapore. The resort has themed lands, hotels and the CityWalk shopping area. It has become a new engine of tourism for the sub-center.\n【中文对照】北京环球度假区 2021 年 9 月 20 日在通州开园，是中国第一家环球主题乐园。它是环球在亚洲的第三座乐园，此前有大阪和新加坡。度假区包括主题园区、酒店和城市大道商业区。它已成为副中心旅游的新引擎。",
