  "title": "问答·城市规划与发展",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How developed is the urban rail network in Beijing?\n【中文对照】北京城市轨道交通发展到什么水平？",
  "qa_answer": "By the end of 2024, the urban rail network of Beijing reached 879 kilometers with 522 stations, the longest among Chinese cities. The first line opened on October 1, 1969, the first subway in China. New lines now reach both airports and the sub-center. For visitors, the subway is often the fastest way across the city.\n【中文对照】到 2024 年底，北京城市轨道交通运营里程达 879 公里、车站 522 座，居全国首位。第一条线路 1969 年 10 月 1 日开通，是中国第一条地铁。新线已通达两座机场和城市副中心。对游客来说，地铁常是穿城最快的办法。",
