  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Danbi Bridge?\n【中文对照】丹陛桥是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "Danbiqiao is a 360-meter elevated walkway, actually a paved ramp, linking Qigutan in the north with Yuanqiu in the south. Walking south along it, one seems to climb gradually toward heaven, for the walkway rises above the cypress wood. The emperor ascended it alone before the rite, symbolic of leaving the earth for heaven.\n【中文对照】丹陛桥是一条长约 360 米、高出地面的海墁大道，北接祈谷坛、南连圜丘坛。自南向北步步升高，人行其上如在古柏林海中升天。祭天前皇帝独行此桥，寓意离开人间、登上天界。",
