  "title": "问答·古柏与九龙柏（Ancient Cypresses）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is special about the trees of the Temple of Heaven?\n【中文对照】天坛的古树有什么名堂？",
  "qa_answer": "The temple grows thousands of ancient cypresses, some over six hundred years old, planted in neat ranks to make a green sea. The most famous one, the Nine-Dragon Cypress, stands near the Hall of Prayer: its twisted trunk looks like nine dragons winding upward. The trees were planted to solemnize the approach to heaven, and the oldest date from the founding of the altar.\n【中文对照】天坛有数千株古柏，部分树龄超过六百年，排列如仪仗，构成绿色林海。最著名的是祈年殿附近的九龙柏，树身螺旋纹理如九龙盘绕。古柏用以烘托通往上天的庄严气氛，最老的与建坛同龄。",
