  "text": "Which numbers best sum up the Temple of Heaven?\n【中文对照】概括天坛的关键数字有哪些？",
  "qa_answer": "Four numbers carry the whole story: 1420, the year of founding; 2.73 million square meters, the area four times the Forbidden City; 22 emperors and 654 ceremonies over five centuries; and 1998, the year of world heritage listing. Add the 38-meter Hall of Prayer and the multiple-of-nine Round Mound, and the temple's grandeur is complete.\n【中文对照】四组数字概括天坛：1420 年建成；占地 273 万平方米、为紫禁城四倍；22 位皇帝举行 654 次祭祀大礼；1998 年列入世界遗产。加上 38 米高的祈年殿与九的倍数的圜丘，天坛的宏伟便一目了然。",
