  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Where were the offerings prepared?\n【中文对照】祭祀供品在哪里制作？",
  "qa_answer": "Offerings were made in the Divine Kitchen, Shenchu, and the animals were slaughtered at the Zaisheng Pavilion, both standing east of Qigutan and linked to the altar by the seventy-two-bay corridor. Everything was prepared under strict cleanliness rules; the water came from special wells, and the cooks wore prescribed dress. The system guaranteed that food for heaven was pure in every sense.\n【中文对照】供品在祈谷坛东侧的神厨制作，牺牲在宰牲亭宰杀，两地与坛以七十二间长廊相连。制作全程有洁净规条：取专用水井之水，厨役着规定服饰，保证祭品从里到外洁净。",
