  "title": "问答·东宫门（The East Palace Gate）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Who wrote the plaque on the East Palace Gate?\n【中文对照】东宫门\"颐和园\"匾是谁写的？",
  "qa_answer": "The three characters Yi He Yuan on the plaque were written by the Guangxu Emperor himself. As the main entrance, the gate opened onto the Court Area, where officials waited for audiences. The stone lions and the gate's heavy red doors with golden studs set the tone of an imperial residence.\n【中文对照】东宫门匾额\"颐和园\"三字为光绪皇帝御笔。东宫门是正门，门内即宫廷区，朝臣在此候旨。门前石狮与朱红宫门金钉，一派皇家气象。",
