  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Who wrote the name plaque of the Chairman Mao Memorial Hall?\n【中文对照】\"毛主席纪念堂\"门额是谁题写的？",
  "qa_answer": "The six characters Mao Zhuxi Jiniantang on the white marble plaque above the entrance were written by Hua Guofeng, then Chairman of the CPC Central Committee. The plaque is set with golden characters and shines above the colonnade of forty-four granite pillars around the square building.\n【中文对照】\"毛主席纪念堂\"汉白玉金字门额由时任中共中央主席华国锋题写。建筑为正方形，四周环立 44 根花岗岩廊柱，门额金字悬于正门上方。",
