  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When was the Great Hall of the People completed, and why was it built so fast?\n【中文对照】人民大会堂是何时建成的？为何这么快？",
  "qa_answer": "The Great Hall of the People was built in only ten months, from October 1958 to September 1959, as the first of the Ten Great Buildings for the tenth anniversary of the People's Republic. Tens of thousands of builders and designers from all over the country worked day and night, and the project was completed in time for the National Day celebration of 1959.\n【中文对照】人民大会堂从 1958 年 10 月动工到 1959 年 9 月建成，仅用十个月，是国庆十周年\"首都十大建筑\"之首。全国数万建设者和设计者昼夜奋战，如期向国庆十周年献礼。",
  "anchor": "1958动工、1959建成、十大建筑、十个月",
