  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How large is the Forbidden City, and what are its dimensions?\n【中文对照】故宫占地面积多大？长宽各多少？",
  "qa_answer": "The Forbidden City covers about 720,000 square meters, roughly the size of one hundred football fields. It measures about 960 meters from north to south and 750 meters from east to west, and the floor area of its buildings is around 150,000 square meters. The compound is enclosed by a ten-meter-high wall and a 52-meter-wide moat called the Tongzi River.\n【中文对照】故宫占地约 72 万平方米，约合 100 个足球场；南北长 960 米、东西宽 750 米，建筑面积约 15 万平方米。四周环以 10 米高的城墙和 52 米宽的护城河——筒子河。",
