  "title": "问答·北京猿人复原形象（What Peking Man Looked Like）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What did Peking Man look like?\n【中文对照】北京猿人长什么样？",
  "qa_answer": "Reconstructions show a short, sturdy figure of about 1.56 meters, with a heavy brow ridge, a low forehead and a braincase of about 1,088 milliliters, smaller than ours but far beyond the apes. He already looked forward to the human line while still carrying deep animal memories.\n【中文对照】复原像显示北京猿人身材矮壮、约 1.56 米，眉嵴粗壮、前额低平，脑量约 1088 毫升——小于现代人，远超猿类。他已迈上人类的道路，身上还带着动物的记忆。",
