  "title": "问答·保护级别（Protection Status）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What protection status does the site hold?\n【中文对照】遗址有什么保护级别？",
  "qa_answer": "The site was listed in the first group of National Key Cultural Relics Protection Units in 1961 and on the World Heritage List in 1987. As a national archaeological site park, it combines conservation, research and public education, and annual digs continue under strict rules.\n【中文对照】遗址 1961 年列入第一批全国重点文物保护单位，1987 年列入世界遗产。作为国家考古遗址公园，它集保护、研究与公众教育于一体，至今仍在规范开展年度发掘。",
