  "id": "QA-GC-001",
  "title": "问答·大运河与北京（The Grand Canal and Beijing）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Grand Canal, and how does it relate to Beijing?\n【中文对照】大运河是什么？与北京有什么关系？",
  "qa_answer": "The Grand Canal is the longest artificial waterway in the world, running 1,794 kilometers from Hangzhou to Beijing. Since the Yuan Dynasty moved the capital north, the canal carried grain, salt and southern goods to the capital for six centuries, and cities like Tongzhou grew rich on the wharves.\n【中文对照】大运河是世界上里程最长的人工水道，全长 1794 公里，南起杭州、北至北京。元代定都后，运河六个世纪里向京师输送漕粮、盐与南方货物，通州等城市因码头而兴盛。",
  "anchor": "1794公里、京杭、漕运",
  "context": "所属模块：问答；出处：2026备考材料·03-九大非讲解景点问答（一）",
