  "title": "问答·申遗成功（World Heritage Listing）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When was the Grand Canal inscribed on the World Heritage List?\n【中文对照】大运河何时列入《世界遗产名录》？",
  "qa_answer": "On June 22, 2014, the Grand Canal was inscribed on the World Heritage List, covering 27 sections of channels and 58 heritage points along 3,000-plus kilometers of historic waterway. In Beijing, sites such as Wanning Bridge and the Tongzhou section joined the listing, and the canal became the city's sixth world heritage site.\n【中文对照】2014 年 6 月 22 日，中国大运河列入《世界遗产名录》，包括 27 段河道与 58 处遗产点。北京的万宁桥、通州段等入选，大运河成为北京第六处世界遗产。",
  "anchor": "2014、27段58点",
