  "title": "问答·漕运规模（Scale of Grain Transport）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How much grain did the canal carry?\n【中文对照】运河的漕运规模有多大？",
  "qa_answer": "At its height the canal moved several million shi of tribute grain north each year, together with salt, tea, silk and porcelain. Granaries, lock systems, towpaths and inspection offices lined the route, and the imperial court lived on this artery. The saying goes that half the empire's wealth floated north on the canal.\n【中文对照】鼎盛时期运河每年北运漕粮数百万石，盐、茶、丝、瓷随之北上；沿线粮仓、船闸、纤道、关卡一应俱全，朝廷命脉系于此。故有\"运河上漂来半个京城\"之说。",
