  "title": "问答·什刹海与积水潭（Shichahai as the Port）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What was Jishuitan?\n【中文对照】积水潭是什么地方？",
  "qa_answer": "Jishuitan, today's Shichahai lakes, was the terminus harbor of the Yuan canal: grain barges moored here in their hundreds, filling the lakes with sails. Marco Polo described the busy market on its shores. Today the lakes keep their water and name, a quiet witness to the port of the empire.\n【中文对照】积水潭即今什刹海一带，是元代运河的终点码头：数百艘漕船停泊湖中，帆樯林立，马可·波罗描写过湖畔市集。今天湖面与地名犹存，静静见证帝国港口的旧日。",
