  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What can visitors see along the canal in Tongzhou today?\n【中文对照】如今通州运河沿线能看到什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The Grand Canal Forest Park stretches for kilometers along the water with wetlands and woodland; the recreated barge wharf and cultural belt connect the Burning-Lamp Pagoda, the historic temples, and the Grand Canal Museum of Beijing opened in 2023 in the sub-center. Boat trips and cycling routes bring the old waterway back to daily life.\n【中文对照】大运河森林公园沿河绵延数公里，湿地与林带相连；复建的漕运码头与文化带串起燃灯塔与古寺群，2023 年北京大运河博物馆在城市副中心开馆。游船与骑行道让古老水道重回日常生活。",
