  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How long is the Beijing Central Axis and what does it cover?\n【中文对照】北京中轴线有多长？覆盖哪些地方？",
  "qa_answer": "The Beijing Central Axis runs 7.8 kilometers from Yongdingmen in the south to the Drum and Bell Towers in the north, through the heart of the old city. It is described as the longest urban axis in the world still standing, the spine on which the capital has been ordered for seven hundred years.\n【中文对照】北京中轴线南起永定门、北至钟鼓楼，全长 7.8 公里，纵贯老城核心。它是世界上现存最长、保存最完整的古代城市轴线，七百年来都是这座城市布局的脊梁。",
