  "title": "问答·申遗成功（The 2024 Inscription）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When was the Beijing Central Axis inscribed on the World Heritage List?\n【中文对照】北京中轴线何时申遗成功？",
  "qa_answer": "On July 27, 2024, at the 46th session of the World Heritage Committee in New Delhi, the Beijing Central Axis, a Building Set Exemplifying the Ideal Order of the Chinese Capital, was inscribed on the World Heritage List. It became Beijing's eighth world heritage site.\n【中文对照】2024 年 7 月 27 日，在印度新德里举行的第 46 届世界遗产大会上，\"北京中轴线——中国理想都城秩序的杰作\"列入《世界遗产名录》，成为北京第八处世界遗产。",
