  "title": "问答·钟鼓楼（The Bell and Drum Towers）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What stood at the northern end of the axis?\n【中文对照】轴线北端的钟鼓楼是做什么的？",
  "qa_answer": "The Drum Tower and the Bell Tower, rebuilt under the Ming, told time for the whole capital: drums at dusk, bell at dawn, the night watches marked by drumbeats. As the highest buildings at the axis's north end, they closed the city with sound, and their restored performances sound again today.\n【中文对照】明代重建的鼓楼与钟楼为全城报时：暮鼓晨钟、更次分明。作为轴线北端最高的建筑，它们以声音为城市收束，如今复原的击鼓表演再次敲响。",
  "anchor": "暮鼓晨钟、报时",
