  "title": "问答·永定门（Yongdingmen）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Yongdingmen?\n【中文对照】永定门是什么建筑？",
  "qa_answer": "Yongdingmen was the southern gate of the Outer City and the southern end of the axis. Demolished in the 1950s, its tower was rebuilt in 2004-2005 on the original site, reopening the axis's southern view. The name means Eternal Stability, the wish that the capital's order stand forever.\n【中文对照】永定门是外城正门、轴线南端。1950 年代城楼被拆除，2004 至 2005 年原址复建，轴线南望景观由此重开。\"永定\"二字，寄寓都城秩序永固之愿。",
  "anchor": "外城正门、2005复建",
