  "title": "问答·景山与轴线制高点（Jingshan on the Axis）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What role does Jingshan play on the axis?\n【中文对照】景山在中轴线上处于什么位置？",
  "qa_answer": "Jingshan, the artificial hill north of the Forbidden City, is the highest point of the axis. From the Wanchun Pavilion on its top, the whole city unfolds: the palace roofs to the south, the Drum and Bell Towers to the north. The hill also hid the axis's fengshui intention, anchoring the palace against the north.\n【中文对照】景山在故宫之北，是中轴线的制高点。登万春亭全城尽览：南望宫阙屋海，北眺钟鼓楼。这座人工土山既是镇山，也是轴线风水的收束之笔。",
