  "title": "问答·广场建筑群（The Square Complex）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which modern buildings joined the axis heritage?\n【中文对照】哪些现代建筑进入了轴线遗产？",
  "qa_answer": "The Tian'anmen Square complex of 1959, the Great Hall of the People, the National Museum, the Monument to the People's Heroes and the Chairman Mao Memorial Hall are among the fifteen components. Their inclusion shows that the axis is a living line, where the modern state redefined the imperial order in its own way.\n【中文对照】1959 年建成的天安门广场建筑群——人民大会堂、国家博物馆、人民英雄纪念碑、毛主席纪念堂——都是 15 处要素的一部分。它们的入选说明轴线是活着的线：现代国家在旧秩序上写下了自己的秩序。",
