  "title": "问答·中轴线数字链（The Number Chain）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which numbers sum up the Central Axis?\n【中文对照】概括中轴线的关键数字有哪些？",
  "qa_answer": "Remember four numbers: 7.8 kilometers, the length from Yongdingmen to the Bell Tower; 15, the heritage components; 700 years, the time since Yuan Dadu drew the line; and July 27, 2024, the day of world heritage listing. With these four, the axis answers any exam question.\n【中文对照】记住四组数字：7.8 公里（永定门至钟鼓楼）、15 处遗产要素、700 余年历史（元大都画线至今）、2024 年 7 月 27 日申遗成功。有这四组，中轴线的问题便都有答案。",
