  "title": "问答·恭王府地位（Status of the Mansion）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the status of Prince Gong's Mansion?\n【中文对照】恭王府有怎样的地位？",
  "qa_answer": "Prince Gong's Mansion on the shore of Shichahai is the best-preserved prince mansion of the Qing. Historian Hou Renzhi summed it up in one line: one Prince Gong's Mansion holds half the history of the Qing, for its owners spanned the dynasty's rise and fall.\n【中文对照】恭王府位于什刹海畔，是清代保存最完整的王府。历史地理学家侯仁之一语概括：\"一座恭王府，半部清代史\"——它的主人串起了清代的兴衰。",
  "anchor": "半部清代史、侯仁之、保存最完整",
