  "title": "问答·府邸与花园（Mansion and Garden）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How is the estate laid out?\n【中文对照】恭王府的布局如何？",
  "qa_answer": "The estate of about sixty thousand square meters divides into the mansion in front and the garden Jincuiyuan behind. The mansion runs in three parallel axes of courtyards, each with its main halls; the garden of 28,000 square meters hides hills, ponds, pavilions and the famous Western-style gate in a landscape of both Chinese and European taste.\n【中文对照】王府占地约 6 万平方米，前府邸、后花园（萃锦园）。府邸三路多进院落、殿堂有序；花园占地 2.8 万平方米，山池亭榭俱全，西洋门点缀其间，中西合璧。",
