  "title": "问答·后罩楼（The Rear Building）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What was the long rear building for?\n【中文对照】后罩楼是做什么用的？",
  "qa_answer": "The two-story rear building runs about 160 meters along the north edge, with over ninety bays, said to be ninety-nine and a half so as never to reach fullness. Its rear wall is pierced by windows of many shapes, each marking a storeroom of Heshen's treasures. It was, in effect, the strongroom of the richest official of the age.\n【中文对照】后罩楼沿府北缘绵延约 160 米、两层，号称九十九间半，取\"届满即盈\"的避讳之意。楼后墙开什锦窗形状各异，一一对应和珅的藏宝库房。说它是当朝首富的保险库，毫不夸张。",
