  "title": "问答·恭王府开放（The Museum Today）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When did the mansion open to the public?\n【中文对照】恭王府何时对公众开放？",
  "qa_answer": "After decades of institutional uses, the state launched a full restoration in the 1980s under the advocacy of Zhou Enlai's instruction, and the garden opened in 1988, the whole mansion in 2008 as a public museum of Qing prince culture. It now exhibits the mansion's history, Qing court life and regular cultural shows.\n【中文对照】经数十年单位占用，国家按周恩来生前指示启动整体腾退修缮：花园 1988 年开放，2008 年府邸全面开放，成为清代王府文化博物馆。如今这里常设王府历史陈列并举办文化活动。",
  "anchor": "1988花园、2008全面开放",
