  "title": "问答·北海的地位（Status of Beihai）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Beihai Park?\n【中文对照】北海公园是一座怎样的园林？",
  "qa_answer": "Beihai, the North Lake, is the oldest surviving imperial garden in Beijing, with over eight hundred years of history from the Jin Dynasty. Centered on Jade Flowery Island amid clear water, it preserves the layout of an imperial lake garden from Liao, Jin, Yuan, Ming and Qing layers.\n【中文对照】北海是北京现存最悠久的皇家园林，自金代算起已有八百余年。全园以琼华岛为中心、湖面开阔，叠压着辽金元明清五代的御苑层理。",
  "anchor": "八百余年、琼华岛、皇家园林",
