  "title": "问答·白塔（The White Dagoba）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the White Dagoba of Beihai?\n【中文对照】北海白塔是什么建筑？",
  "qa_answer": "The White Dagoba, raised in 1651 under the Shunzhi Emperor, is a Tibetan-style stupa 35.9 meters high on Jade Flowery Island, built at the request of a Tibetan lama and to bind the empire's Buddhist policy. Its white body crowns the island, and the pagoda's shape has become the logo of the park.\n【中文对照】白塔建于顺治八年（1651 年），为藏式覆钵塔，高 35.9 米，矗立琼华岛之巅，兼具礼佛与联结西藏的用意。白塔与绿岛相映，已成北海乃至北京的标志景观。",
  "anchor": "1651、藏式白塔、35.9米",
