  "title": "问答·永安寺与善因殿（The Temples on the Island）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What buildings stand under the dagoba?\n【中文对照】白塔之下有哪些殿宇？",
  "qa_answer": "Below the dagoba runs the axis of Yongan Temple, from the mountain gate up through the halls to the small gilded Shanyin Hall at the very top before the pagoda. Stone steps and archways climb the green hill, so the island reads like a vertical temple garden.\n【中文对照】白塔之下是永安寺中轴线，自山门拾级而上直至塔前善因殿。石阶、牌坊沿绿山攀升，整座琼华岛宛如一座立体的寺观园林。",
