  "title": "问答·九龙壁（The Nine-Dragon Screen）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Nine-Dragon Screen of Beihai?\n【中文对照】北海九龙壁是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The Nine-Dragon Screen of 1756 is a double-sided glazed screen wall with nine dragons on each face, the only double-sided dragon screen in China. Built of multicolored glazed bricks, it once shielded a temple hall. Dragons ripple across it in blue, green and gold, the peak of glazed-tile craft.\n【中文对照】北海九龙壁建于 1756 年（乾隆二十一年），双面各雕九龙，是全国唯一的双面九龙壁。七彩琉璃拼砌、龙姿翻腾，是琉璃工艺的巅峰之作，原为殿前照壁。",
