  "title": "问答·团城与大玉瓮（The Circular City）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What treasures stand on the Circular City?\n【中文对照】团城上有什么宝物？",
  "qa_answer": "The Circular City at the south gate keeps the Hall of Receiving Light with a jade Buddha, and in its courtyard sits the Big Jade Jar, Dushan Dayuhai, carved in 1265 for Kublai Khan's banquets, the largest existing jade vessel of the Yuan. Old pines said to be named by Qianlong shade the walls.\n【中文对照】团城承光殿供白玉佛；院内摆放元代 1265 年雕成的渎山大玉海（大玉瓮），是忽必烈的贮酒器、现存最大的元代玉器。乾隆赐名古松掩映城墙，团城因而有\"城中园林\"之趣。",
