  "title": "问答·静心斋（The Garden of Quiet Heart）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Jingxinzhai?\n【中文对照】静心斋是什么地方？",
  "qa_answer": "Jingxinzhai on the north shore is a miniature garden of halls, ponds, bridges and rockeries called the Qianlong Little Garden. Stacked stones frame changing views in a few acres, and the Qing emperors came here for quiet after court. It is the finest small garden inside an imperial lake garden.\n【中文对照】静心斋位于北岸，人称\"乾隆小花园\"：厅堂、水池、小桥、假山浓缩于数亩之间。皇帝罢朝后至此静心，是皇家湖园中最为精巧的园中之园。",
