  "title": "问答·五龙亭（The Five Dragon Pavilions）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What are the Five Dragon Pavilions?\n【中文对照】五龙亭是什么样的建筑？",
  "qa_answer": "On the northwest shore, five pavilions stand in a line over the water on stone piers, connected by bridges, their roofs curling like dragons. Built in 1602, they served imperial fishing and Buddhist rites, and today they frame the classic postcard view of the White Dagoba across the lake.\n【中文对照】西北岸五座亭子以石桥相连、伸入水中，檐角如龙首昂起，建于 1602 年（万历三十年）。帝后曾在此垂钓礼佛，如今是隔湖眺望白塔的经典取景框。",
