  "title": "问答·琼岛春阴碑（Spring Shade on the Jade Isle）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the stele of Qiongdao Chunyin?\n【中文对照】\"琼岛春阴\"碑是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "One of the Eight Scenes of Yanjing, Spring Shade on the Jade Isle is recorded on a stele inscribed by Emperor Qianlong in 1751, standing on the east slope of the island. When spring mists wrap the green hill, the old capital found its softest view, and the stele keeps the imperial aesthetic certificate.\n【中文对照】\"琼岛春阴\"为燕京八景之一，乾隆御笔碑立于琼华岛东坡（1751 年）。春日雾霭环山、绿意如烟，老北京最温柔的景色由此定格，御碑便是帝王的审美证书。",
