  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What does Beihai offer visitors today?\n【中文对照】今天的北海能为游客提供什么？",
  "qa_answer": "Visitors row boats under the dagoba, walk the lotus lakes in summer, hear the chimes of the pagoda in wind, and taste imperial snacks at Fangshan, the imitation imperial restaurant. As a park since 1925, it mixes morning exercisers, chorus singers and tourists, keeping both the imperial scene and the street life of Beijing.\n【中文对照】游人在白塔下泛舟、夏日赏荷、听塔铃声声，还可到仿膳饭庄尝宫廷小吃。北海 1925 年起辟为公园，晨练者、合唱团与游客同园，皇家气象与市井生活同框。",
