  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Why is Jingshan called the highest point of the Central Axis?\n【中文对照】景山为何是中轴线制高点？",
  "qa_answer": "The Wanchun Pavilion on the hilltop stands higher than any building on the axis, about 45 meters above the ground. Standing there, one sees the Forbidden City's golden roofs to the south and the Drum and Bell Towers to the north, the whole axis in one glance, which is why photographers and exam candidates alike climb it first.\n【中文对照】景山万春亭高于中轴线所有建筑，登临可南望紫禁城金顶、北眺钟鼓楼，一条轴线尽收眼底。这里是俯瞰故宫全景与中轴线的最佳点位。",
