  "title": "问答·寿皇殿（The Shouhuang Hall）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What was the Shouhuang Hall used for?\n【中文对照】寿皇殿是做什么用的？",
  "qa_answer": "The Shouhuang Hall complex on the north side of the hill, rebuilt grandly by Emperor Qianlong, enshrined the portraits of deceased emperors and empresses of the Qing, and the family held great memorial rites there. Restored and opened in 2018, it now exhibits the ritual of Qing imperial ancestor worship.\n【中文对照】寿皇殿建筑群位于景山北侧，乾隆年间大修，供奉清代帝后御容画像，是皇家祖祭之所。2018 年修缮后开放，现陈列清代帝后祭祖礼制。",
