  "title": "问答·绮望楼（The Qi Wang Lou）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Qiwanglou?\n【中文对照】绮望楼是什么建筑？",
  "qa_answer": "Qiwanglou stands on the hill's south gate axis facing the Forbidden City's north gate. Built in 1750, it enshrined the tablet of Confucius for the palace students, so it was a school shrine inside the imperial hill, and its name means gazing at the beauty of the capital.\n【中文对照】绮望楼踞景山南门轴线上、正对故宫神武门，建于 1750 年，曾供奉孔子牌位供宫学子弟拜谒。楼名意为观览京华之美。",
