  "title": "问答·罪槐与纪念（The Guilty Scholar Tree）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Is the original tree of Chongzhen still there?\n【中文对照】崇祯自缢的老槐树还在吗？",
  "qa_answer": "The original crooked tree was lost in the twentieth century; the tree standing today was replanted, and a stele titled the place where Ming Sizong died for his country. The simple marker turns a hilltop into a lesson on the fall of dynasties.\n【中文对照】当年的老槐已失，今天的树为补植，旁立明思宗殉国处碑。一处山脚小景，记着一个王朝崩溃的瞬间。",
