  "title": "问答·景山与镇山（The Guardian Hill）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Why build a hill behind the palace?\n【中文对照】为什么要在皇宫后面堆一座山？",
  "qa_answer": "In geomancy the north is the seat of darkness, so a hill behind the palace blocks it and guards the throne's back. It also completed the axis rhythm: palace low, hill high, towers higher again. Jingshan is thus at once a fengshui screen and a composition mark.\n【中文对照】风水上北方属阴，皇宫靠山可镇之，护龙脉、背有靠。同时景山补足轴线节奏：宫低、山高、楼更高。它既是镇山，也是构图之笔。",
  "anchor": "镇山、风水、背有靠",
