  "title": "问答·景山公园今昔（Jingshan Today）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Jingshan like as a park?\n【中文对照】景山公园今天什么样？",
  "qa_answer": "Opened as a park in 1928, Jingshan joins the World Heritage buffer of the axis. Morning singers gather under old cypresses, and at dusk the hilltop floods with photographers waiting for the golden light on the palace roofs. It is the cheapest ticket for the most expensive view in Beijing.\n【中文对照】景山 1928 年辟为公园，今属中轴线遗产缓冲区。晨有歌者聚于古柏之下，暮有摄影者在万春亭等故宫金顶亮起。一张便宜的门票，换来北京最贵的视角。",
