  "title": "问答·景山数字卡（The Number Card）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which facts should one memorize about Jingshan?\n【中文对照】景山要记哪些要点？",
  "qa_answer": "Five points cover the exam: artificial hill, made from moat earth under Yongle; Coal Hill legend; Chongzhen hanged himself here in 1644; five pavilions of 1750 with Wanchun at the axis top; and Shouhuang Hall reopened in 2018. Add the best-view title and the card is complete.\n【中文对照】五点覆盖考试：永乐挖河泥堆山；民间称煤山；1644 年崇祯自缢；1750 年建五亭、万春亭踞轴线最高点；寿皇殿 2018 年重新开放。再加一句\"俯瞰中轴线最佳点\"，这张卡就齐了。",
