  "title": "问答·龙潜福地（The Dragon-Hidden Land）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Why is it called the land where a dragon once hid?\n【中文对照】为什么说雍和宫是\"龙潜福地\"？",
  "qa_answer": "Two emperors lived here before their reigns: Yongzheng as a prince, and Qianlong was born in this compound in 1711. A house that raised two emperors was deemed blessed by the dragon, and the temple's golden roofs reflect that imperial pedigree.\n【中文对照】两位皇帝与这里相关：雍正在此居住为藩，乾隆 1711 年出生于此。一府出二帝，被视为龙潜之福，殿顶的黄瓦也昭示着它的皇家血统。",
