  "title": "问答·万福阁檀木大佛（The Sandalwood Buddha）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the great Buddha of Wanfu Pavilion?\n【中文对照】万福阁的檀木大佛是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The Wanfu Pavilion houses a standing Maitreya Buddha carved from a single white sandalwood trunk, twenty-six meters tall with eight meters underground, a gift sent by the Seventh Dalai Lama from Tibet in the 1750s. It is listed by Guinness as the world's largest wooden Buddha carved from one tree.\n【中文对照】万福阁供站姿弥勒菩萨像，由整根白檀木雕成，地上 18 米、地下 8 米、总高 26 米，是 1750 年代七世达赖喇嘛从西藏进献的整木。它被吉尼斯纪录认定为世界最大的独木雕佛。",
  "anchor": "白檀木、26米、七世达赖进献",
