  "title": "问答·木雕三绝（The Three Woodcarving Wonders）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What are the three woodcarving wonders of the temple?\n【中文对照】雍和宫的木雕三绝是什么？",
  "qa_answer": "They are the sandalwood Buddha of Wanfu Pavilion, the Five Hundred Arhats Mountain in Falun Hall carved of sandalwood and gold, and the nanmu niches in the Hall of the Illuminating Buddha, carved of golden-thread nanmu. Together they display the summit of Qing court woodcraft.\n【中文对照】三绝为：万福阁檀木大佛、法轮殿檀香木五百罗汉山、照佛楼金丝楠木佛龛。三件均出清宫匠作，代表清代木雕的巅峰。",
