  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What happens in the Falun Hall?\n【中文对照】法轮殿有什么功能？",
  "qa_answer": "Falun Hall is where lamas chant and hold great rites; its roof carries five small pavilions in Tibetan style, and inside sits a great gilded statue of Tsongkhapa, founder of the Gelug school. The hall is the working heart of the monastery's daily practice.\n【中文对照】法轮殿是喇嘛诵经与举办大法会之处：屋顶五座藏式天窗小殿，殿内供格鲁派创始人宗喀巴大师鎏金像。此殿是寺院日常修行的核心。",
