  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How do the styles of Yonghegong blend?\n【中文对照】雍和宫的建筑风格如何融合？",
  "qa_answer": "The layout follows the Han palace line of courts and halls, while details carry Tibetan taste: gold cylindrical roofs, Tibetan window trims, pillars wrapped in colored cloth, and tangka scrolls inside the halls. Han, Manchu, Mongolian and Tibetan elements meet in one compound, mirroring the empire's own fabric.\n【中文对照】总体沿汉式宫殿院落布局，细节则见藏风：金顶圆柱、藏式窗楣、彩布缠柱、殿内唐卡高悬。汉、满、蒙、藏元素同院共处，正是多元一体格局的建筑写照。",
