  "title": "问答·香火与祈愿（Incense and Wishes）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Why is Yonghegong so popular with worshippers?\n【中文对照】雍和宫为何香火如此旺盛？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing people say men go to Yonghegong and women to Hongluo Temple, and on New Year's Eve the queue for incense circles the blocks for hours. Worshippers ask for career, study and safety, and the temple hands out free incense to all, a custom started to curb fire risks and waste. Its blend of imperial history and living faith makes it unique.\n【中文对照】京城素有\"男雍和、女红螺\"之说，除夕夜请香队伍绵延数小时。香客所求多为事业、学业与平安；寺院免费发放短香，既防火患又去浪费。皇家历史与活态信仰在此交汇，成就了它的独特地位。",
