  "title": "问答·法会与跳布扎（The Great Rites）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What are the big ceremonies of the temple?\n【中文对照】雍和宫有哪些大法会？",
  "qa_answer": "The Great Prayer Festival around the Lunar New Year includes the Vajra dance, Dabuzha, in which masked lamas dance to expel evil, drawing huge crowds on the first day of the first lunar month. Monthly chanting and the Buddha's birthday rites also fill the calendar, keeping the Gelug liturgy alive in the capital.\n【中文对照】农历新年的大愿祈祷法会中有跳布扎（金刚驱邪神舞），戴面具的喇嘛起舞驱祟，正月初一人山人海。月度诵经与佛诞法会相继不断，格鲁派仪轨在京城得以活态传承。",
