  "title": "问答·雍和宫数字卡（The Number Card）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which facts must one remember about Yonghegong?\n【中文对照】雍和宫要记哪些要点？",
  "qa_answer": "Remember: built 1694 as a prince's mansion, palace after 1722, lamasery in 1744; two emperors connected with it; the 26-meter single-trunk sandalwood Buddha; the Golden Urn of 1793; and the three woodcarving wonders. These six points answer most questions about the temple.\n【中文对照】记住六点：1694 年建府、1722 年升宫、1744 年改寺；一府出二帝；26 米独木檀佛；1793 年金瓶掣签；木雕三绝。答雍和宫之问，基本都在这六点之内。",
