  "title": "问答·双奥之城（The Double-Olympic City）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What makes Beijing unique in Olympic history?\n【中文对照】北京在奥运史上有何独特地位？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing is the only city in the world to have hosted both the Summer and the Winter Olympic Games: the Summer Games in 2008 and the Winter Games in 2022. The Olympic Park in the north of the city carries both memories, from the 2008 opening on August 8 to the 2022 opening on February 4.\n【中文对照】北京是世界上唯一同时举办过夏季和冬季奥运会的\"双奥之城\"：2008 年夏奥、2022 年冬奥。城市北部的奥林匹克公园承载着两段记忆——2008 年 8 月 8 日与 2022 年 2 月 4 日两个开幕之夜。",
