  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What happened to the Water Cube between 2008 and 2022?\n【中文对照】水立方在 2008 到 2022 年间发生了什么？",
  "qa_answer": "The National Aquatics Center, the Water Cube, built of pillow-like ETFE membranes, won swimming glory in 2008. For 2022 it was converted into the Ice Cube, with a curling sheet laid over the pool, the first venue in the world to switch between water and ice on the same site.\n【中文对照】国家游泳中心\"水立方\"以气囊式 ETFE 膜结构著称，2008 年见证游泳荣耀；2022 年改造成\"冰立方\"，泳池之上铺冰壶赛道，成为全球首个在同一场地实现水冰转换的场馆。",
