  "title": "问答·冰丝带（The Ice Ribbon）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Ice Ribbon?\n【中文对照】冰丝带是哪个场馆？",
  "qa_answer": "The National Speed Skating Oval, nicknamed the Ice Ribbon for its band of lights around the roof, was the new venue of 2022, with the largest low-carbon ice sheet in Asia, about 12,000 square meters. World records fell on its ice, made with natural carbon-dioxide cooling.\n【中文对照】国家速滑馆昵称\"冰丝带\"，屋顶灯带如丝带环绕，是 2022 年新建场馆，拥有约 1.2 万平方米的亚洲最大冰面，采用二氧化碳跨临界直冷制冰，多项世界纪录诞生于此。",
