  "qa_answer": "The Olympic Tower rises 246.8 meters from a grove by the park, a cluster of five tower shafts joined like a tree of life, topped by the Olympic rings, the permanent rings installation of the city. Its decks offer the best aerial view of the axis's northern extension.\n【中文对照】奥林匹克塔高 246.8 米，五塔簇拥如生命之树，塔顶常年悬挂奥运五环，是城市五环标志的永久落点。登塔可俯瞰中轴线北延长线的全景。",
