  "qa_answer": "A water body shaped like a dragon winds through the park's central axis, with the Aohai lake at its head. It cools the summer air, mirrors the Bird's Nest at dusk, and carries the symbolism of the dragon at the axis's northern end.\n【中文对照】一条形似巨龙的水系沿公园中轴蜿蜒，龙头处为奥海。它夏日降温、暮色中倒映鸟巢，也在中轴线北端点出\"龙\"的意象。",
