  "qa_answer": "Yes. The 1990 Asian Games made this district Beijing's first modern sports cluster, with the Asian Games Village and gymnasiums north of the old north axis. The 2008 and 2022 Olympics then raised the area to world stage, so the park holds three layers of games history.\n【中文对照】1990 年亚运会使这里成为北京第一个现代体育集聚区，亚运村与场馆群落在旧北中轴延长线上。2008 与 2022 两届奥运将其推向世界舞台——一园之内三层赛会记忆。",
