  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What cultural facilities stand in the park?\n【中文对照】公园里有哪些文化场馆？",
  "qa_answer": "Beyond stadiums, the park hosts the China Science and Technology Museum, the National Convention Center, the Museum of Chinese Arts and Crafts opened in 2022, and the Exhibition Hall of the History of the CPC. The north axis thus doubles as a culture corridor.\n【中文对照】除场馆外，园内还有中国科学技术馆、国家会议中心、2022 年开放的中国工艺美术馆（中国非物质文化遗产馆）与中国共产党历史展览馆，北中轴由此兼作文化走廊。",
  "anchor": "科技馆、工艺美术馆、党史馆",
