  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How are the Olympic venues used now?\n【中文对照】奥运场馆现在如何再利用？",
  "qa_answer": "The Bird's Nest hosts tours, winter fun and large events; the Ice Cube keeps public curling and swimming in summer; the Ice Ribbon opens public speed-skating lanes. The model of post-Games reuse turned the park into a national fitness and tourism landmark instead of white elephants.\n【中文对照】鸟巢开放参观、承办大型活动；冰立方夏泳冬冰壶；冰丝带向公众开放大道速滑。赛后利用让公园成为全民健身与旅游地标，而没有变成闲置的\"白象\"。",
