  "qa_answer": "Beijing 2022 left the Ice Ribbon, the water-ice conversion, three hundred million people engaged in winter sports, and the slogan Together for a Shared Future. The park's venues, the slogan stones and the winter festivals keep the Games alive year round.\n【中文对照】北京 2022 留下冰丝带、水冰转换技术、三亿人参与冰雪运动与\"一起向未来\"口号。园区场馆、口号石与冰雪嘉年华让冬奥一年四季可感。",
