  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which facts cover the Olympic Park exam card?\n【中文对照】奥林匹克公园的考点要点有哪些？",
  "qa_answer": "Say these five: Beijing is the only double-Olympic city, 2008 and 2022; the Bird's Nest and Water Cube of 2008; the Ice Cube conversion and the Ice Ribbon of 2022; the 246.8-meter Olympic Tower with the rings; and the dragon water system on the north axis extension. This set answers the exam's needs.\n【中文对照】记住五点：全球唯一双奥之城（2008 与 2022）；2008 的鸟巢与水立方；2022 的水冰转换与冰丝带；246.8 米的奥林匹克塔与五环标志；北延长线上的龙形水系。答奥园之问，五点足矣。",
