  "title": "问答·左庙右学（Temple Left, School Right）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What does the layout of temple and school mean?\n【中文对照】\"左庙右学\"是什么规制？",
  "qa_answer": "On Guozijian Street, the Confucius Temple stands to the east and the Imperial College to the west, following the classic rule of temple left and school right from the Book of Rites. Worship of the sage and education of officials were thus housed together, the twin engines of the empire's ideological order.\n【中文对照】国子监街上，东为孔庙、西为国子监，依《周礼》\"左庙右学\"之制而建。祭圣与育士同处一街，构成帝国意识形态与人才生产的双引擎。",
