  "title": "问答·孔庙始建（Founding of the Temple）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When was the Beijing Confucius Temple built?\n【中文对照】北京孔庙建于何时？",
  "qa_answer": "The temple was founded in 1302 in the Yuan Dynasty and completed in 1306, as Dadu established state worship of Confucius. Emperors of Yuan, Ming and Qing came here twice a year to offer sacrifices, at the spring and autumn ceremonies, sometimes officiating in person.\n【中文对照】北京孔庙始建于元大德六年（1302 年），1306 年建成，此后元明清三代皇帝每年春秋两祭，有时亲临行礼。它是国家级祭孔场所。",
  "anchor": "1302、元代、春秋两祭",
