  "title": "问答·大成殿（The Hall of Great Achievement）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Dacheng Hall?\n【中文对照】大成殿是一座怎样的殿宇？",
  "qa_answer": "Dacheng Hall is the main hall, where the tablet of Confucius receives offerings. Its yellow glazed roof marks imperial rank, and in its courtyard stand rows of stele pavilions recording imperial sacrifices, and replicas of the ancient Stone Drums stand before the hall.\n【中文对照】大成殿为主殿，供孔子牌位、行释奠礼。黄琉璃瓦顶昭示皇家规制，院内碑亭列列记载历代祭孔盛事，殿前陈列仿古石鼓。",
  "anchor": "大成殿、释奠礼、黄琉璃瓦",
