  "title": "问答·进士题名碑（The Jinshi Steles）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What are the Jinshi name steles?\n【中文对照】进士题名碑刻了什么？",
  "qa_answer": "One hundred and ninety-eight steles in the temple's lanes record the names of 51,624 jinshi of the Yuan, Ming and Qing, the graduates of the empire's highest examination. Finding one's ancestor's name here is a pilgrimage for many families, and the grove of stones is a marble register of five centuries of talent.\n【中文对照】孔庙内 198 通进士题名碑，刻有元明清三代 51,624 名进士的姓名籍贯，是全国科举最高一级考试的大理石名册。许多人来此寻访先人题名，碑林如半部科举史。",
