  "title": "问答·触奸柏（The Remonstrance Cypress）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the legend of the Chujian Cypress?\n【中文对照】触奸柏有什么传说？",
  "qa_answer": "A great cypress by the hall is called the Chujian cypress, the tree that rebuked the traitor. Legend says when the corrupt minister Yan Song passed, a gale swung a branch and knocked off his hat, so the tree earned its name as nature's censor. Students today touch it for exam luck.\n【中文对照】大成殿旁古柏名\"触奸柏\"：相传奸臣严嵩路过，狂风摆枝掀落其乌纱，柏树因此得名，俨然天然御史。今考生常来摸柏祈愿。",
  "anchor": "触奸柏、严嵩传说",
