  "title": "问答·国子监的地位（The Imperial College）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What was the Guozijian?\n【中文对照】国子监是什么机构？",
  "qa_answer": "The Guozijian was the highest school and administration of education in Yuan, Ming and Qing, where the jiansheng students studied the classics for office. Founded here in 1306 alongside the temple, it trained generations of officials and set the model of central Confucian education.\n【中文对照】国子监是元明清三代最高学府与教育管理机构，监生在此研习经义、以备任官。1306 年与孔庙同街建成，培养数代官员，是中央官学的最高范本。",
  "anchor": "最高学府、监生、1306",
