  "title": "问答·辟雍（The Biyong Hall）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the Biyong?\n【中文对照】辟雍是一座怎样的建筑？",
  "qa_answer": "The Biyong, built in 1783-1784 under Qianlong, stands on a square island in a round pool, linked by four bridges, a round-water-square-hall image of heaven and earth. The emperor came here to lecture, Lin Yong Jiang Xue, with officials kneeling on the banks, the empire's grandest class.\n【中文对照】辟雍建于乾隆四十八至四十九年（1783-1784），方形大殿踞圆形水池中央、四桥通达，取\"圜水方殿\"天圆地方之意。皇帝在此\"临雍讲学\"，官员环池跪听，堪称帝国最大的一堂课。",
  "anchor": "辟雍、临雍讲学、1784",
