  "title": "问答·成贤街（Chengxian Street）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is special about the street itself?\n【中文对照】国子监街（成贤街）有什么特别之处？",
  "qa_answer": "The street is shaded by old locusts and marked by four painted archways, one of the best preserved ancient street scenes in the city. Its name means Becoming a Worthy, for walking it toward temple and school symbolized the road to virtue. It keeps the city's quietest imperial tone.\n【中文对照】国子监街古槐夹道、四座彩绘牌楼跨街，是北京保存最完好的古街景之一。街名\"成贤\"，寓意走向庙学即走向贤德。一条安静的街，保住了帝都最静雅的调子。",
