  "qa_answer": "Yes. Every September 28, the birthday of Confucius, a grand释?释奠 ceremony with ritual music and dance is performed at the temple, and students begin their school year with first-writing rites here. The old state rite has become a public culture festival.\n【中文对照】每年 9 月 28 日孔子诞辰，孔庙举行大型释奠礼，八佾乐舞齐备；学童还在此举行开笔礼。国家旧典如今是公众文化节庆。",
