  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Which numbers sum up the temple and school?\n【中文对照】概括孔庙和国子监的关键数字有哪些？",
  "qa_answer": "Keep five: 1302, the founding year of temple and college; 198 steles with 51,624 jinshi names; the Biyong of 1784; nearly two hundred steles of the 630,000-character Stone Classics; and September 28, the day of the grand ceremony. With these, the two compounds are fully covered.\n【中文对照】记住五组：1302 年始建；198 通碑、51,624 名进士；1784 年辟雍建成；近 200 通碑刻 63 万字石经；9 月 28 日祭孔大典。有此五组，庙学考点全部覆盖。",
