  "id": "QA-FS-019",
  "title": "问答·珠算（Chinese Zhusuan）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is zhusuan, and when was it inscribed?\n【中文对照】珠算是什么？它何时列入名录？",
  "qa_answer": "Zhusuan is the traditional Chinese calculation with an abacus, inscribed in December 2013. The abacus did calculations by moving beads on rods, and it served Chinese commerce for centuries before electronic calculators. A folk saying praises a skilled hand as an abacus that never misses a bead. Though calculators have replaced it in shops, it is still taught as a training of mental arithmetic.\n【中文对照】珠算是以算盘进行的传统中国计算方法，2013 年 12 月列入。算盘拨珠运算，在电子计算器出现之前的几个世纪里支撑着中国商业。民谚把精于计算的人比作\"铁算盘\"。虽然商店里已被计算器取代，它仍作为珠心算训练得以传承。",
  "anchor": "珠算、2013年、算盘",
