  "title": "问答·太极拳（Taijiquan）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "When was taijiquan inscribed, and what is its link with Beijing?\n【中文对照】太极拳何时列入？它与北京有何渊源？",
  "qa_answer": "Taijiquan was inscribed in December 2020. The martial art combines slow movements with breathing and the philosophy of yin and yang. The Yang style, one of its major schools, was founded by Yang Luchan, who taught in Beijing in the late Qing period. In Beijing parks every morning, thousands of residents still practice taijiquan together.\n【中文对照】太极拳 2020 年 12 月列入。这门武术把缓慢的招式与呼吸及阴阳哲学结合在一起。主要流派之一的杨式太极拳，由清末在北京授拳的杨露禅创编。每天清晨，北京公园里仍有成千上万的市民一起打太极。",
