  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Who is Lord Rabbit in Beijing folk culture?\n【中文对照】北京民俗中的兔儿爷是谁？",
  "qa_answer": "Lord Rabbit is a painted clay rabbit figure of Beijing, born from the legend of the Moon Rabbit that came down to cure people of a plague. The figure usually rides a tiger, an elephant or a lotus seat, wearing armor and holding a pestle. It became the festival toy of the Mid-Autumn Festival, and old Beijingers offered it with mooncakes. Today it is a city-level heritage item and a popular souvenir.\n【中文对照】兔儿爷是北京彩绘泥塑兔神，源自月宫玉兔下凡为人祛除瘟疫的传说。形象多骑虎、骑象或骑莲座，披甲执杵。它是中秋节的节令玩具，老北京人曾与月饼一同供奉。如今它是市级非遗项目和受欢迎的伴手礼。",
  "anchor": "兔儿爷、中秋、泥塑",
