  "title": "问答·京绣（Beijing Embroidery）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is Beijing embroidery known for?\n【中文对照】京绣以什么著称？",
  "qa_answer": "Beijing embroidery, or Jingxiu, grew out of the embroidery workshops that served the imperial court. It uses gold thread, bright colors and strict symmetry, and dragon and phoenix motifs once belonged to the palace alone. Together with the other three crafts it forms the four famous embroideries of the north. It is listed as a national-level intangible cultural heritage.\n【中文对照】京绣源自为宫廷服务的绣作。它用金线、色彩浓艳、构图对称，龙凤纹样曾为皇家专用。它与其他三种工艺并称北方四大名绣。京绣已列入国家级非物质文化遗产名录。",
  "anchor": "京绣、宫廷、金线",
