  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How many museums does Beijing have?\n【中文对照】北京有多少家博物馆？",
  "qa_answer": "By early 2026, Beijing had 249 registered museums and 88 museum-like venues, the largest number among all Chinese cities. The city holds the goal of building a city of museums in its plan. More than one hundred museums offer free admission, and the Palace Museum alone receives tens of millions of visitors a year. On a talk route, it is safe to say Beijing is the museum capital of China.\n【中文对照】到 2026 年初，北京已有备案博物馆 249 家、类博物馆 88 家，数量居全国城市之首。城市规划提出建设\"博物馆之城\"的目标。一百多家博物馆免费开放，仅故宫博物院每年就接待数千万人次。讲解时可以说，北京就是中国的博物馆之都。",
