  "title": "问答·中国美术馆（National Art Museum of China）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is the National Art Museum of China?\n【中文对照】中国美术馆是什么场馆？",
  "qa_answer": "The National Art Museum of China is the national gallery of fine arts, opened in 1963 on Wusi Street. Chairman Mao Zedong wrote the name of the museum in calligraphy. Its collection of more than 100,000 works covers traditional painting, oil painting, sculpture and folk art. Free tickets are booked online, and its exhibitions of contemporary art draw long queues.\n【中文对照】中国美术馆是国家美术殿堂，1963 年在五四大街开馆。馆名由毛泽东主席题写。十余万件藏品涵盖国画、油画、雕塑与民间美术。免费票需网上预约，当代艺术大展常常一票难求、排起长队。",
