  "title": "问答·中国电影博物馆（China National Film Museum）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What is special about the China National Film Museum?\n【中文对照】中国电影博物馆有什么特别之处？",
  "qa_answer": "The China National Film Museum opened in December 2005, marking the centenary of Chinese cinema. It is regarded as the largest professional film museum in the world. Its galleries tell the 100-year history of Chinese film from the first film Dingjunshan of 1905 to modern productions. Visitors can also watch films in its giant IMAX screens.\n【中文对照】中国电影博物馆 2005 年 12 月开馆，纪念中国电影百年。它被认为是世界上最大的专业电影博物馆。各展厅讲述中国电影百年历程，从 1905 年第一部电影《定军山》到当代作品。观众还可以在馆内巨幕影厅观影。",
