  "title": "问答·平北抗日战争纪念馆（Pingbei Memorial）",
  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Where is the Pingbei Anti-Japanese Memorial?\n【中文对照】平北抗日战争纪念馆在哪里？",
  "qa_answer": "It stands in Yanqing District, in the mountains of the old Pingbei base area north of the Great Wall. The memorial records the guerrilla war of soldiers and civilians in the Pingbei region, with martyrs' monuments and a hall of relics. It keeps the memory of the resistance in the mountainous north of Beijing.\n【中文对照】平北抗日战争纪念馆位于延庆区海坨山下，地处长城之外的平北抗日根据地山区。纪念馆记载平北军民的敌后游击斗争，建有烈士纪念碑与文物陈列厅，保存着京北山区的抗战记忆。",
