  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What local products should visitors take home?\n【中文对照】游客该带哪些北京特产回家？",
  "qa_answer": "Classic gifts include Quanjude vacuum-packed roast duck, Tongrentang medicine and herbal pills, Wuyutai jasmine tea, Neiliansheng cloth shoes, Rongbaozhai's woodblock prints, cloisonné vases, and preserved fruits. Each item carries a shop's century, which is why gifts from Beijing are gifts with stories.\n【中文对照】经典伴手礼有：全聚德真空烤鸭、同仁堂药品与养生茶、吴裕泰茉莉花茶、内联升布鞋、荣宝斋木版水印、景泰蓝花瓶、果脯蜜饯等。每件都带着一家老号的百年故事，所以北京的礼物是有故事的礼物。",
