  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What conduct does the regulation prohibit for travel agencies?\n【中文对照】条例禁止旅行社哪些经营行为？",
  "qa_answer": "Agencies must not lure tourists with unreasonably low prices and recover costs through shopping kickbacks, must not make false publicity, and must arrange services strictly according to the contract. Tour routes, standards and prices should match what was agreed, and changes require the tourists' consent.\n【中文对照】条例禁止以\"不合理低价\"招徕并通过购物回扣填补成本，禁止虚假宣传；旅行社应按合同约定安排行程与服务，擅自变更行程、降低标准均属违法，变更须经旅游者同意。",
