  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What must a guide do or not do under the regulation?\n【中文对照】条例对导游执业有哪些要求？",
  "qa_answer": "Guides must hold valid credentials, follow the arranged itinerary, explain truthfully and serve courteously. They must not change the itinerary without consent, force or trick tourists into shopping, demand tips, or sell goods to tourists. Violations face fines and possible suspension.\n【中文对照】导游须持证执业、按行程安排提供服务、如实讲解、文明礼貌；不得擅自变更行程、不得强迫或变相强迫购物、不得索要小费、不得向旅游者兜售物品。违者依法处罚直至暂停执业。",
