  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How does the regulation deal with illegal one-day tours?\n【中文对照】条例如何治理非法\"一日游\"？",
  "qa_answer": "It requires one-day tour operators to run through licensed agencies with signed contracts, and bans impersonating travel agencies, soliciting tourists on streets or online in fake names, and altering routes without consent. Information such as agency name, price and complaint telephone must be clearly posted, and tourists are advised to book through formal channels.\n【中文对照】条例要求\"一日游\"业务由合法旅行社经营并签订合同，严禁冒用旅行社名义、街头或网络假名揽客、擅自改变行程；经营信息（旅行社名称、价格、投诉电话等）应公示。游客应通过正规渠道预约。",
