  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What does the regulation say about homestays?\n【中文对照】条例对民宿有什么规定？",
  "qa_answer": "The regulation pioneered municipal homestay rules: urban and rural residents may run homestays in their own houses under safety and hygiene standards, with fire safety first, and villages may develop clustered homestay operations under planning. This gave courtyard homestays a legal basis in Beijing.\n【中文对照】条例在全国率先对民宿作出规定：城乡居民可利用自有住宅依法从事民宿经营，须符合安全、卫生等标准，突出消防安全；村庄可依规划发展民宿集群，为四合院民宿、乡村民宿提供法律依据。",
