  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What must scenic areas do about visitor capacity?\n【中文对照】条例对景区游客承载量有什么要求？",
  "qa_answer": "Scenic areas must work out and publicize their maximum carrying capacity, take reservation and flow-control measures during peak times, and inform visitors when the capacity approaches the limit. This protects both visitor experience and heritage safety, a point Beijing takes seriously for its world heritage sites.\n【中文对照】景区应当核定并公布最大承载量，高峰期实行预约、疏导等措施，接近承载量时及时公告限流。这既保护游览体验，也保护遗产安全，对北京的世界遗产景区尤为重要。",
