  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "How does the regulation handle ticket prices?\n【中文对照】条例对门票价格有什么规定？",
  "qa_answer": "Ticket prices of parks and scenic areas invested by the government follow public-interest principles and price-law procedures; adjustments require hearings and advance publication, and preferential tickets are provided for students, seniors and other groups. Scenic areas should also offer electronic tickets and reservation services.\n【中文对照】政府投资的景区门票实行公益导向，调价须依法听证并提前公布；对学生、老年人等实行优惠票价。景区应提供电子票与预约服务，方便游客。",
