  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Does the regulation cover online travel business?\n【中文对照】条例是否规范网络旅游经营？",
  "qa_answer": "Yes. Whoever organizes tourism through the internet must obtain the required licenses and display them truthfully, take responsibility for the services sold on the platform, and protect tourists' personal information. Online solicitation cannot escape the same rules as offline business.\n【中文对照】规范。通过互联网组织旅游业务的经营者须取得相应许可并如实公示，对平台上销售的产品与服务承担责任，并保护旅游者个人信息——线上揽客与线下经营适用同样规则。",
