  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What does the regulation say about civilized tourism?\n【中文对照】条例对文明旅游有何要求？",
  "qa_answer": "Tourists should observe social order, protect resources and heritage, and respect local customs; travel operators and guides have the duty to guide and remind civilized behavior. Serious uncivilized acts may be recorded under the national record system for uncivilized tourism behavior.\n【中文对照】旅游者应遵守公共秩序、保护旅游资源与遗产、尊重当地风俗；经营者与导游负有引导、提示文明旅游的义务。严重不文明行为可依国家规定纳入\"旅游不文明行为记录\"。",
