  "qa_answer": "The city should build tourism consultation centers, tourist distribution centers, signage in key languages, toilets and parking in line with standards, and publish timely traffic and weather information for travelers. Public transport should connect major scenic areas to make travel convenient.\n【中文对照】城市应建设旅游咨询中心、旅游集散中心，完善多语种标识、旅游厕所、停车场等设施，及时发布出游交通与天气信息；公共交通应衔接主要景区，方便游客出行。",
