  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What safety duties does the regulation set?\n【中文对照】条例规定了哪些安全保障义务？",
  "qa_answer": "Tourism operators must ensure their facilities meet safety standards, buy liability insurance as required, prepare emergency plans, and warn tourists of risks in advance. During emergencies operators must organize rescue and report promptly, and guides are the first-line organizer of evacuation and care.\n【中文对照】旅游经营者须保证设施设备符合安全标准，依规定投保责任险，制定应急预案并事先向旅游者提示风险；突发事件中应立即组织救助并及时报告。导游是现场处置与游客照料的第一线组织者。",
