  "qa_answer": "Tourists may complain to the culture and tourism department or call the 12345 hotline; the department accepts complaints according to the national complaint-handling rules, mediates disputes and supervises corrections. Operators should set up in-house complaint channels and reply within the prescribed time.\n【中文对照】旅游者可向文化和旅游主管部门投诉或拨打 12345 热线；主管部门依《旅游投诉处理办法》受理、调解并监督整改。经营者应建立内部投诉渠道并在规定时限内答复。",
