  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "Why should a Beijing guide master this regulation?\n【中文对照】北京导游为什么要掌握这部条例？",
  "qa_answer": "Because it is the daily law of our work: contracts, itineraries, one-day tours, homestays and safety duties all run under it. The exam asks its core systems, and on the road the regulation protects both tourists and guides who follow it. A guide who knows the rules is the first safeguard of a lawful tour.\n【中文对照】因为它是我们日常工作的直接依据：合同、行程、一日游、民宿、安全义务都在其规范之内。机考可能直接问其核心制度；带团中依条例办事，既保护旅游者，也保护导游自己——懂规则的导游是合法团队的第一道保障。",
