  "qa_answer": "On October 24, 2025, the NPC Standing Committee designated October 25 as Taiwan Retrocession Day, marking October 25, 1945, when the Chinese government restored sovereignty over Taiwan after the victory of the War of Resistance. The first commemoration was held in 2025 at the eightieth anniversary.\n【中文对照】2025 年 10 月 24 日，全国人大常委会决定设立台湾光复纪念日（10 月 25 日），纪念 1945 年 10 月 25 日中国政府恢复对台湾行使主权；2025 年为首个纪念日（80 周年）。",
