  "qa_answer": "China extended the visa-free transit stay to 240 hours, ten days, covering 65 ports in 24 provinces, and kept widening the list of countries enjoying unilateral visa-free entry, with the figures subject to the latest announcements of the National Immigration Administration. These policies helped inbound tourism grow fast and supported guides working with foreign guests.\n【中文对照】中国将过境免签停留时间延长至 240 小时（10 天），适用 24 个省份 65 个口岸，单方面免签国家范围持续扩大（以国家移民管理局最新发布为准），入境旅游快速增长。",
