  "qa_answer": "The Zhengyangmen gate tower reopened on July 27, 2026, after six years of closure, on the second anniversary of the Central Axis's world heritage listing of July 27, 2024. Together with the cleared and connected Temple of Agriculture and the repair of Yongdingmen, it marks the axis's busiest preservation season.\n【中文对照】2026 年 7 月 27 日，正阳门城楼时隔 6 年重新开放，恰逢中轴线申遗成功两周年（2024 年 7 月 27 日申遗成功）。加上先农坛腾退贯通、永定门系统性修缮，是中轴线保护的高产之年。",
