  "qa_answer": "The festival opened on September 19 at the Huanghuacheng Water Great Wall in Huairou's Jiuduhe area. It follows the 2025 edition themed Great Wall Covenant, Harmony and Coexistence in Yanqing, and pairs with the renovated China Great Wall Museum at Badaling, which passed final inspection in June 2026.\n【中文对照】2026 年长城文化节 9 月 19 日在怀柔九渡河黄花城水长城开幕；2025 届在延庆、主题\"长城之约·和合共生\"。与 2026 年 6 月竣工的中国长城博物馆（八达岭）改造提升工程互为呼应。",
