  "subject": "科目五 导游服务能力（现场考试）",
  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What does the notice on tourism-vehicle seatbelts require guides to do?\n【中文对照】旅游客运安全带文件对导游提出什么要求？",
  "qa_answer": "The notice issued by the general offices of the culture-tourism, public-security and transport ministries in 2023 sets five no-rent rules for tour vehicles and requires guides to remind passengers to fasten seatbelts before departure, supervise wearing during the drive, and remind again after rest stops. Refusing to wear one is a safety issue, not a mere habit.\n【中文对照】文旅、公安、交通运输三部委办公厅 2023 年联合发文，明确旅游包车\"五不租\"；导游须在发车前提醒系安全带、行车途中监督提醒、途中休息再次发车时再次提醒。游客拒不系安全带属安全问题，应依规处理。",
