  "module": "知识问答（英语）",
  "text": "What targets does the Plan for Building a Tourism Power in the 15th Five-Year period set?\n【中文对照】《旅游强国建设\"十五五\"规划》设定了什么目标？",
  "qa_answer": "The plan, issued by the Ministry of Culture and Tourism with State Council approval, targets by 2030: 8.3 billion domestic trips, 7.7 trillion yuan of tourism spending, 190 million inbound visitors and 150 billion US dollars of inbound tourism revenue. It arranges national tourism belts and lists inbound facilitation measures, with Beijing as a pivot city of the inbound promotion program.\n【中文对照】该规划由文化和旅游部经国务院同意印发，提出到 2030 年国内出游 83 亿人次、旅游总花费 7.7 万亿元、入境游客 1.9 亿人次、入境旅游收入 1500 亿美元；部署多条旅游带与入境便利化措施，北京为入境旅游促进计划支点城市。",
